WEBVTT

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.440
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:12.710
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:14.510
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:21.990
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.720
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:29.390
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:36.370
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:45.240
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:56.390
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:00.600
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:04.260
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:11.410
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:20.280
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.810
Phizele, arise!

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:58.250
Demon Marshal, I take your
summons as a great honor.

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:01.720
You are courteous as usual, Phizele.

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:05.950
Etiquette is not my only talent.

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:10.950
My magical power reveals the beast
lurking within the human head!

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:14.430
I summoned you in order
to display that power.

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:17.260
Go now onto the human world!

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:20.250
I shall go wherever you command!

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.800
And if Devilman should appear?

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.310
You need not worry.

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:30.310
I can transport the humans to a
place even his Devil Eye cannot see!

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:37.700
DEMON PHIZELE
THE INSANE SHADOW

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:43.720
This shall do!

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:46.800
Go my shadows, and expose the
truth of the human hearts!

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:58.870
TOY ASSEMBLY HALL

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:03.380
I heard your son has been placed
into a prestigious preschool.

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:04.880
It must be very expensive.

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:09.580
No, price is nothing
for a good education.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:13.190
Also, I heard your son passed the
entrance exam for the magnet school.

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:20.470
Heh, you always buy the cheapest
chopped pork and fish sausage!

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:25.130
Your little brat passed the exam?
How much did you "donate" to them?

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:27.170
You might as well throw
money down the drain!

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:29.070
You dare say such a thing to me?

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:30.170
Yeah, I do!

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:32.770
- How shameful!
- You absolute cow!

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:33.970
Why you...

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:34.480
Oh my!

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.910
Mama, bye-bye!

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:43.290
Whew, finally free from my tests!

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:52.960
Watch out, slowpoke!

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.630
Don't mess with me, you bastard!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.700
Bastard!

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:00.800
Stop this at once!

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:04.410
Stop this, you two.
When it comes to fighting...

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:07.050
You better leave it to us!

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:17.850
This blows! Why did I spend my life
counting other people's money?

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:19.590
I quit!

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:27.530
Akira! Akira!

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:29.730
My dear Akira!

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.430
Hey, there you are!

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:34.380
Hi, my dear Akira!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.480
"My dear Akira", she says...

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:44.980
Sorry, I guess you're mistaken.
Akira only loves me!

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.480
Human language is complicated!

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:49.320
What the hell do you want?

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:51.320
What do I want...

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:54.820
Oh, yes! There are strange
things happening in the streets.

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:56.720
Strange? What do you mean?

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:59.090
For instance...

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:00.700
There! Look over here!

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:15.050
I've wanted to do this forever!

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.660
Dad!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:41.670
This is as bad as we can get.

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:58.790
How exhilarating!

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:02.900
That hurt, Mr. Officer!
Officer!

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:08.240
- They've all gone crazy!
- No.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:14.170
It doesn't seem like it.
The children are still acting normal.

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:15.410
Normal?

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:23.110
This is car that almost
hit me the other day!

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.340
All right!

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:26.110
Let's get him!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.210
Take this, jerk!

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:29.520
Take this!

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:35.090
GET INTO A FIRST-RATE UNIVERSITY

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:36.730
Stupid thing!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.060
Who the hell wants to study this way?

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.770
What do grades even have
to do with education?

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:49.240
I'm sorry! Forgive me!

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:51.010
I only went into teaching for the money!

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:54.550
I don't understand.
This is insane!

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:58.090
What caused this commotion?

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:01.080
Don't worry, it'll settle down.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:04.760
For now, just get yourself
home safely. Okay?

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.090
Hey, what about me?

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:10.630
I don't care, do whatever!
You're so annoying!

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:13.130
Oh my, don't push yourself!

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:18.130
I understand your feelings.
You're just being shy.

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:20.270
And it would be best hide that from Miki.

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:24.100
- What was that?!
- Okay! Okay! Enough!

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:27.050
We're all going home,
so take it easy. Okay?

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:33.520
Geez...

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.460
Bastard!

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:54.380
Give it here!

00:07:57.110 --> 00:08:00.380
Demon Phizele.
His shadow's is behind this!

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:06.850
When it overtakes humans, it
brings out their dark side.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:12.620
You could say they've gone mad. Or you
could say they're acting more human.

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:16.560
But at this rate, they’re gonna
kill each other like animals!

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:21.270
Look out!

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:26.470
Damn!

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:30.980
Lala, take care of Miki!

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:47.690
Cool!

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:51.300
My Akira is amazing!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:54.390
"My Akira," she says...

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.740
Thanks for cheering for me!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:02.650
Stop resisting!

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:15.320
Damn, you're kidding.
It's one thing after another!

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:18.560
MAKIMURA

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:24.700
We're in the clear.
We should be fine now.

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:28.060
I wonder if Tare and his
friends made it home safe?

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:31.530
They got out a lot earlier
than we did. I'll go and see.

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.710
I'm home! Where's Tare?

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:40.210
Welcome home, but he's not back yet.

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:41.980
He's still not back?

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:44.720
What am I gonna do with him?
He's so hopeless!

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:58.930
Tare hasn't come home yet,
so you're in charge now.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:02.160
Phizele's shadow is near, understand?

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:07.160
Yup! I'll protect My Akira's
poor unrequited lover!

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:10.200
Unrequited?! Me?!

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:14.680
Calm down! She'll be
helpful if something happens.

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:22.250
Miki, let's go inside the house.

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:23.390
It's this way.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:25.190
I know that!

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.120
Phizele, where are you?

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:33.200
Where will you cast your shadow next?

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:44.840
Fall my shadow! Run my shadow!

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:49.480
Peel away the intelligence and culture
that hides the true human heart!

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:55.010
Prove beyond a doubt that, while they
may call themselves higher primates,

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:58.230
scratch the surface and
they're no more than monkeys!

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.770
We as humans must study diligently
until the clay we die.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:16.680
Though I am a great man, I still
study. That's why I'm great!

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:23.450
Why am I just wasting away in here?

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:33.750
Hey, cutie pies! Let's play!

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:35.330
Hello!

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:41.030
What the?! What are you doing?!
OUCH!

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:44.230
NAKADO ACADEMY

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:47.000
Help! Help me!

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:49.900
I'll pay whatever you want!

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.540
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:54.750
Help!

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:58.720
That's the principal's voice!

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:03.450
Help me! Let me go please!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:07.230
Hey! What're you doing? What the hell?!

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:11.460
Wait! Even/one!
What's going on?

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:19.040
That is quite peculiar.

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:27.190
The students and the principal
are all gone. I'll go, too.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:34.050
— Itchy!
— That man is unaffected
by my shadow's magic?

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:39.720
I forgot to go to the bathroom!

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:43.190
Times like this...
There we go!

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.800
It's not like I haven't done it before!

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:57.300
This is normal for him?

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:59.710
How is it that he's not gone mad?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.120
Am I the one who has gone mad?

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:09.390
Phizele's shadow!

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:13.570
I feel better now.

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:18.760
I cannot forgive any human
who resists my magic!

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:21.360
I shall not stand for it!

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:24.160
Slacking off on the job sure is fun!

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:27.640
I can go home and put some
cream on my athlete's foot.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:35.240
I shall not let a human
such as yourself live!

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:39.920
Wh-What is this?
I do believe I shall faint!

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:49.890
Pardon my manners, but you must die!

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.130
Phizele!

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:55.330
Devilman!

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:59.070
You've been more careless than usual.

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:02.940
You seem to have forgotten that
I live among the humans now.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:05.110
I shall be on my way, then.

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:09.390
DEVIL!

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.780
Devil Wing!

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:18.290
Wait!

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:22.030
He's still following me!

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:29.200
Everyone's gone nuts!

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:31.360
Help, Principal!

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:34.210
I was gonna ask you for help!

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:38.510
Heave ho! Heave ho!

00:14:38.510 --> 00:14:42.740
I can't die before going
on a date with Miyo!

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:44.350
Same!

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:57.060
He's late.

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:59.830
He's late. What if something's
happened to him?

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:03.230
My Akira would never
be beaten so easily.

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:06.000
Put yourself ill at ease, Miki.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.840
Put yourself QUITE
at ease, not ill at ease!

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:13.270
Human language is so difficult!

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:14.550
Huh?

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:21.890
A tank?

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:32.460
I'm sick of keeping
the peace! Fire at will!

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:43.180
Heave-ho, heave-ho,
heave-ho, heave-ho.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:48.910
I never thought war would break out here!

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:00.230
I never miss my mark!

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:02.430
Enemy attack!

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:08.410
It's just a pencil.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:10.880
This'll do.

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:16.380
Take this!

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:21.220
I don't get it...

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.420
Devil Chop!

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:33.060
Devil Kick!

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:40.870
Damn...

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:44.440
How truly pathetic!

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:50.180
Here we go!

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.350
Dammit!

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:14.560
Our Demon Marshal's clothing
is cut from this cloth.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:16.460
So, of course,
it's extraordinary.

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:18.870
As you yourself can see!

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:20.710
Devil Wing!

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:25.810
Devil Cutter!

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:43.520
Tare!

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:45.230
Miyo!

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:48.760
Hey, you won't hold back this time, right?

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:51.970
Hurry up and throw 'em in! Drown them!

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:54.470
This is hopeless!
What should we do?

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:57.070
- Miyo!
- Tare!

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:01.250
I'm so sad, I'm gonna drown alone!

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:17.030
I'm scared! This is why I hate humans!

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:20.200
You're really useless.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:27.170
Tare!

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:28.670
Miyo!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.240
- Stop it!
- I'm gonna die!

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:33.340
How long do we have to do this?

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:43.860
It looks like you have no
choice but to surrender!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.210
Devil Beam!

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:08.880
They're acting really strange!

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:15.160
They've come to their senses.

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:27.500
Were we really going to
hold maneuvers here?

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:33.130
It still puzzles me.
Why is it that man was unaffected?

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:34.800
Isn't it obvious, Phizele?

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:38.300
Alphonne is uneducated and
uncouth to begin with.

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:41.270
How could he lose his mind
if he hasn't got one to lose?

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.310
It's that simple.

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:44.910
I understand...

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:47.690
I regret to say that I am dying.

00:19:50.320 --> 00:19:53.520
They say it's the challenge
of spiritual healing...

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:57.300
You saved us, Alphonne, and
you don't even know it.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:19:59.670
What the?

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:04.300
F-Fudo!

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:06.670
What is it, sir?

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:09.900
Go stand in the hallway!

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:11.580
My sincere apologizes.

00:20:12.570 --> 00:20:14.810
Just consider this a little thank you.

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:16.240
Later.

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:18.590
A thank you?

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:50.010
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:56.750
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.580 --> 00:21:04.400
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:10.210
Who Devilman really is

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:14.170
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:17.370
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:22.370
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:33.260
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:53.280
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:59.490
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:04.950
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:12.090
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:16.860
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.860 --> 00:22:19.870
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:26.550
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.970 --> 00:22:36.680
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:22:58.410 --> 00:23:00.280
Come forth , Kilskey!

00:23:24.400 --> 00:23:28.230
To punish Lala's betrayal, the Demon
Marshal sends forth an assassin:

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:30.180
Demon Kilskey.

00:23:34.710 --> 00:23:37.210
Lala's kidnapping is a success.

00:23:39.210 --> 00:23:44.090
Then, Kilskey uses Lala as bait
to plot Devilman's demise.

00:23:54.360 --> 00:23:55.430
Damn!

00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:12.910
“lf you want Lala back,
come to the school at sunrise.“

00:24:15.820 --> 00:24:18.320
Devilman resolutely meets the challenge.

00:24:21.090 --> 00:24:22.320
Where's Lala?

00:24:22.320 --> 00:24:23.890
Look there!

00:24:23.890 --> 00:24:27.630
Demon Kilskey's awful trap awaits him!

00:24:40.170 --> 00:24:42.150
Devil Beam!

00:24:43.480 --> 00:24:48.320
Next time on Devilman:
DEMON KILSKEY, THE
CRIMSON TORNADO
